{"1492100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fantasy Network", "steam_appid": 1492100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE NETWORK – THE WORLD’S FIRST SOCIAL MEDIA METROIDVANIA</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492100/extras/4249348076ad0235c4dfb247a5fbc8b2.poster.avif?t=1786021474\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492100/extras/4249348076ad0235c4dfb247a5fbc8b2.webm?t=1786021474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492100/extras/4249348076ad0235c4dfb247a5fbc8b2.mp4?t=1786021474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Explore. Fight. Post.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fantasy Network</i> turns the <strong>metroidvania</strong> genre upside down, combining tight <strong>2D platforming</strong> with a <strong>satirical </strong>story about fame, influencers, and saving the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lyn’s morning is officially ruined: her mother has been kidnapped! The ransom? Victory in the President’s Race.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save her family, Lyn must win vicious talent shows, honing her skills to a razor's edge. Travel through the colorful lands of Holua, battle bizarre enemies, make friends across her journey, and dig up the ancient truth buried beneath the world’s shiny surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492100/extras/5b1865a6a396e8391f42bbf554e39268.poster.avif?t=1786021474\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492100/extras/5b1865a6a396e8391f42bbf554e39268.webm?t=1786021474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492100/extras/5b1865a6a396e8391f42bbf554e39268.mp4?t=1786021474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HELP LYN FULFILL HER MISSION IN A COLORFUL, HAND-DRAWN ACTION ADVENTURE!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world without limits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interconnected </strong>map filled with hidden shortcuts, secret zones, and eccentric NPCs. Explore evocative environments ranging from sunny beaches and scorching volcanoes to freezing glaciers and ancient temples- you’ll even blast off into <strong>cosmic space</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Acrobatic skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a challenging gameplay loaded with action with jumps, double-jumps, somersaults, and rapid dashes in its platformer levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492100/extras/c7a3396e2f567ea2c6ed5b2eae513bd4.poster.avif?t=1786021474\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492100/extras/c7a3396e2f567ea2c6ed5b2eae513bd4.webm?t=1786021474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492100/extras/c7a3396e2f567ea2c6ed5b2eae513bd4.mp4?t=1786021474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a colorful variety of enemies using your <strong>umbrella</strong>. Switch between its various configurations to adapt to any threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The influencer lifestyle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep in constant touch with Holua's citizens via social apps. Chat for intel, post photos of your adventures, and gather <strong>likes</strong> to grow your fan base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shop &amp; scroll</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>Crebits</strong> (the world's electronic currency) to buy new equipment, download essential smartphone apps, and purchase travel tickets to enjoy city attractions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492100/extras/f9e0b9d62f2d729363c61c503e325559.poster.avif?t=1786021474\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492100/extras/f9e0b9d62f2d729363c61c503e325559.webm?t=1786021474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492100/extras/f9e0b9d62f2d729363c61c503e325559.mp4?t=1786021474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win the presidency</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s not just about fighting- compete in <strong>cooking, racing, gaming, dance, and fashion</strong> talent shows. Win them all to become the new President of Holua!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the mystery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into side quests to piece together the complete history of Holua and reveal the incredible secret that its inhabitants are completely unaware of.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro downtime</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need a break from adventuring? Chill out with <strong>four playable retro pixel-art arcade games</strong> or just hang out with the locals.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This isn't just a fantasy game. It's a colorful, glitchy, hilarious critique of the screen you're looking at right now.</h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE NETWORK – THE WORLD’S FIRST SOCIAL MEDIA METROIDVANIA</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492100/extras/4249348076ad0235c4dfb247a5fbc8b2.poster.avif?t=1786021474\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492100/extras/4249348076ad0235c4dfb247a5fbc8b2.webm?t=1786021474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492100/extras/4249348076ad0235c4dfb247a5fbc8b2.mp4?t=1786021474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Explore. Fight. Post.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fantasy Network</i> turns the <strong>metroidvania</strong> genre upside down, combining tight <strong>2D platforming</strong> with a <strong>satirical </strong>story about fame, influencers, and saving the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lyn’s morning is officially ruined: her mother has been kidnapped! The ransom? Victory in the President’s Race.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save her family, Lyn must win vicious talent shows, honing her skills to a razor's edge. Travel through the colorful lands of Holua, battle bizarre enemies, make friends across her journey, and dig up the ancient truth buried beneath the world’s shiny surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492100/extras/5b1865a6a396e8391f42bbf554e39268.poster.avif?t=1786021474\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat