li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The influencer lifestyle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep in constant touch with Holua's citizens via social apps. Chat for intel, post photos of your adventures, and gather <strong>likes</strong> to grow your fan base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shop &amp; scroll</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>Crebits</strong> (the world's electronic currency) to buy new equipment, download essential smartphone apps, and purchase travel tickets to enjoy city attractions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492100/extras/f9e0b9d62f2d729363c61c503e325559.poster.avif?t=1786021474\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492100/extras/f9e0b9d62f2d729363c61c503e325559.webm?t=1786021474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492100/extras/f9e0b9d62f2d729363c61c503e325559.mp4?t=1786021474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win the presidency</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s not just about fighting- compete in <strong>cooking, racing, gaming, dance, and fashion</strong> talent shows. Win them all to become the new President of Holua!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the mystery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into side quests to piece together the complete history of Holua and reveal the incredible secret that its inhabitants are completely unaware of.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro downtime</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need a break from adventuring? Chill out with <strong>four playable retro pixel-art arcade games</strong> or just hang out with the locals.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This isn't just a fantasy game. It's a colorful, glitchy, hilarious critique of the screen you're looking at right now.</h2>", "short_description": "Join Lyn in a colorful, cartoonish world of Holua where &quot;Likes&quot; are the ultimate power! Explore a non-linear world, master umbrella-based combat, and smash your way through talent-show boss battles. It’s a metroidvania with a social media soul- no subscription needed.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492100/0356548d500ba6600dc66d11112415c92d515e7d/header.jpg?t=1786021474", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492100/a665b674f981ce84d85bc3202be9604435782b8f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786021474", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492100/a665b674f981ce84d85bc3202be9604435782b8f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786021474", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8.1/10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Dual-Core 2.6 GHz / AMD Dual-Core Athlon 3.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> SM 3.0 con 512MB VRAM; NVIDIA GeForce 8500 GT / AMD Radeon HD 4650 or higher<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-Core Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> SM 3.0 with 1GB VRAM; NVIDIA GeForce GTX 280 / AMD Radeon HD 4830 or greater<br></li><li><strong>Di